{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:10.60.370","page_type":"section"},"citation":"10.60.370","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.370","content_hash":"2e625c8fe76fa604e664871a58719b35ada0377410564eff4fa79200c292a617","heading":"Exemptions.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.370:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.370","text":"(a) All exemptions applicable to time-restricted parking zone violations pursuant to Article IV of this chapter shall also be applicable to time-restricted parking zones in this article.\n(b) Any person eligible to acquire a permit and related identification tag to exempt such person from this article may be exempted thereupon.\n(c) No exemptions from this article give a person exemption from any other sections of the code unless otherwise exempted therefrom. (Ord. 20566 § 17, 6-10-25.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"c71c6234-0523-55de-8e05-8e777adfa649"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.370","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.370","content_hash":"557625318d5751517dc0d3f28cd8cc004ddacf7b8ec06a788af54771a4c45b08","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.370:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.370:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.370","text":"(a) All exemptions applicable to time-restricted parking zone violations pursuant to Article IV of this chapter shall also be applicable to time-restricted parking zones in this article.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"77a8f5d6-7509-5db3-85ef-a3e7c4361474"},{"a